===Etymology===
See {{w|Name of the Philippines}} in Wikipedia for a complete etymology.

Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|Philippines}}, originally from {{der|en|es|Filipinas}}, which was from {{m|es|Felipe|tr=the name of a king of {{m|en|Spain}}}}.

