* {{a|US|UK}} {{enPR|fĭlʹĭ-pēnz}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈfɪl.ɪ.pinz/|/ˈfɪl.ə.pinz/}}
* {{audio|en|En-us-Philippines.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|Phil|i|ppines}}

